  "location": "50 CFR part 550",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Marine Mammal Commission: 2 references to 29 CFR part 1613, removed in 1995",
      "summary": "In the CFR chapters assigned to the Marine Mammal Commission, 2 references in 2 sections cite 29 CFR part 1613 or sections in that part. EEOC removed this part effective August 21, 1995 (60 FR 43371). The eCFR of October 27, 2026 goes from part 1612 to part 1614.",
      "impact": "A reader who follows these references finds no text at the cited address. No effect on a decision or an amount has been established.",
      "correction": "The agency decides how to update each reference. The 1995 rule says part 1614 replaced the complaint process in part 1613. We did not map sections one to one."
    }
  },
